{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121289","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121289/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121289/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121289/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121289","id":4867666127,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7wxL5e","number":121289,"title":"Fix out-of-bounds access on invalid binary resource string length","user":{"login":"xczcxczxzcz","id":283870210,"node_id":"U_kgDOEOuEAg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/283870210?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xczcxczxzcz","html_url":"https://github.com/xczcxczxzcz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xczcxczxzcz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xczcxczxzcz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xczcxczxzcz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xczcxczxzcz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xczcxczxzcz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xczcxczxzcz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xczcxczxzcz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xczcxczxzcz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xczcxczxzcz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-07-12T15:43:07Z","updated_at":"2026-07-12T16:19:51Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121289","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121289","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121289.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121289.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"`ResourceLoaderBinary::get_unicode_string()` and the static `get_ustring()` read the string length with `int len = f->get_32()`. A stored length with bit 31 set becomes negative, so the `len > str_buf.size()` guard is skipped and the buffer is never resized. `len` is then widened to `uint64_t` for `FileAccess::get_buffer(uint8_t *, uint64_t)`, becoming a huge count. On the first call `str_buf` is empty, so `&str_buf[0]` aborts with an out-of-bounds index; after an earlier string has grown `str_buf`, `get_buffer` writes past it.\n\n`get_unicode_string()` reads every string in the binary format (type, paths, the string table, property names), so a malformed `.res`/`.scn`/`.tres` reaches it immediately. `get_ustring()` is on the binary-to-text conversion path.\n\nThe length is now read as `uint32_t`, the zero case returns before any indexing, and a `resize` failure (an oversized length) sets `ERR_FILE_CORRUPT` and stops instead of reading into a buffer that is too small.\n\nRepro: save a resource as `.res`, set the type-string length at byte offset 24 to `0xFFFFFFFF`, load it.\n\nBefore: `FATAL: Index p_index = 0 is out of bounds (size() = 0)`, the process crashes.\nAfter: the load fails with an error and returns null; valid resources still load.\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121289/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121289/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}